[00:23.20]1. Jehovah knows just what we need
[00:30.68]To bring us joy and to succeed.
[00:36.96]So he provides so many ways
[00:42.60]In which to serve and spend our days.
[00:50.76](Chorus)
[00:50.76]Reaching out, giving all,
[00:52.86]for our God above.
[00:52.90]And where the need is great, there we’ll be,
[00:52.92]reaching out in love.
[00:54.36]2. There’s work to do in ev’ry land.
[00:54.36]Where there’s a need, we lend a hand.
[00:54.36]By reaching out, we show we care.
[00:54.36]We want to help and want to share.
[00:54.36](Chorus)
[00:54.36]Reaching out, giving all,
[00:57.14]for our God above.
[01:01.40]And where the need is great, there we’ll be,
[01:09.04]reaching out in love.
[01:24.24]3. And here at home, in towns nearby,
[01:24.32]We plan, we build, new skills we try.
[01:25.06]We learn to speak a foreign tongue
[01:27.16]And bring good news to ev’ryone.
[01:27.28](Chorus)
[01:40.38]Reaching out, giving all,
[01:46.70]for our God above.
[01:52.16]And where the need is great, there we’ll be,
[01:59.32]reaching out in love.
